# Patch: 13_program_cache.diff
# Lever: L7 -precompile N (reworked: the programs of the run's distinct lengths are prepared ahead of the loop by jax's AOT path — trace, lower, compile on N host threads — no forward is run, nothing is discarded, the featurized inputs are kept for the loop) and L13 -program_cache DIR (new: every program this process compiles is serialized under DIR and LOADED by later processes instead of traced, lowered and compiled again; af2ig_opt.programs). Per new signature a `program` timer record says where the first call's seconds went (t_trace, t_lower, t_compile, t_store | t_load).
# Numerics class: NONE (exact: the executable run is the one jit would build for the same arguments — AOT — or the one this stack built and serialized; the same output bytes)
# Default: off in the driver (stock: jax traces and compiles each new length lazily inside the loop, in every process); the kit passes both in every mode
# Applies to: af2_initial_guess/predict_pdb.py as left by patches 00-12 (apply in numeric order with `patch -p1` from the dl_binder_design checkout root)
